<title>UK: Jardine Matheson H1 net profit slips.</title>
<headline>Jardine Matheson H1 net profit slips.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30</p>
<p>			   ($ million unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (cents)		36.35		  vs 44.26</p>
<p> Dividend (cents)	 7.80		   vs 7.80</p>
<p> Net profit		 212.5		  vs 257.3</p>
<p> Turnover		   5,567.8		vs 5,147.9</p>
<p>Note - Chairman Henry Keswick said in a statement with results that &quot;the trading profit for the full year is not expected to reach last year's level.&quot;</p>
</text>
